OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker brings you
OL,7,     Fexclusive live performances,
OL,8,     Fincluding Schumann's Piano
OL,9,     FConcerto and Mendelssohn's A
OL,10,     FMidsummer Night's Dream.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,12,     F5/5. Donald Macleod traces
OL,13,     FRameau's final years, including
OL,14,     Fthe reception to his final stage
OL,15,     Fwork and his pursuit of a pay
OL,16,     Frise.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FPianist David Kadouch plays live.
OL,19,     FJonathan Coe on his new book.
